---
// PastorWelcome.astro
// Pastor photo, welcome quote, and "What we believe" section.
// Two-column layout on desktop.
---

<section id="pastor-welcome" class="bg-[#F4EFE5] py-20 md:py-28 px-6 md:px-16 animate-fade-up">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12">
    <!-- Left: Photo + quote -->
    <div class="flex-1">
      <!-- Pastor Ronald preaching -->
      <img
        src="/photos/DSC05106.jpg"
        alt="Preacher Ronald Slamet speaking at New Hope Church"
        class="w-full aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl mb-6 object-cover shadow-[0_2px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]"
      />

      <blockquote class="font-serif italic text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#111111] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        &ldquo;We believe church should be the safest place to ask hard questions,
        doubt out loud, and discover what God is really like.&rdquo;
      </blockquote>
      <p class="text-[#111111]/70 leading-relaxed mb-2">
        Our hope is that every person who walks through our doors feels seen,
        valued, and loved &mdash; not judged.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#111111]/70 leading-relaxed">
        We&rsquo;re a community that takes the Bible seriously and grace even more
        seriously.
      </p>
      <p class="font-semibold text-[#111111] mt-4">
        &mdash; Pastor Ronald Slamet
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: What we believe -->
    <div class="flex-1">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-medium text-[#085CFC] mb-3">
        What we believe
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-serif italic text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#111111] mb-8 leading-snug">
        Three things hold us together.
      </h2>

      <!-- Belief blocks -->
      <div class="space-y-0">
        <!-- The Gospel -->
        <div class="border-t border-black/[0.08] py-5">
          <h3 class="font-serif italic text-xl text-[#111111] mb-2">The Gospel</h3>
          <p class="text-[#111111]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            The good news is that God has made a way for every person to be in
            relationship with Him through Jesus Christ. It&rsquo;s not about what
            we do &mdash; it&rsquo;s about what He&rsquo;s already done.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- The Bible -->
        <div class="border-t border-black/[0.08] py-5">
          <h3 class="font-serif italic text-xl text-[#111111] mb-2">The Bible</h3>
          <p class="text-[#111111]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We believe the Bible is God&rsquo;s Word and the ultimate authority for
            how we live. It&rsquo;s not just a book of rules &mdash; it&rsquo;s a
            story of redemption that speaks into every area of our lives.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- The Spirit -->
        <div class="border-t border-b border-black/[0.08] py-5">
          <h3 class="font-serif italic text-xl text-[#111111] mb-2">The Spirit</h3>
          <p class="text-[#111111]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            God&rsquo;s Spirit lives in every believer, guiding, empowering, and
            transforming us from the inside out. We rely on Him for wisdom,
            strength, and direction every day.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
